# Design System Rules

## 1. Tokens & Status Colours
Tokens live in `src/styles/tokens.css` and are exposed via Tailwind in `src/styles/globals.css`:
- Backgrounds: `--bg #F3F5F7`, `--surface #FFFFFF`, `--subtle #E9EEF2`
- Borders: `--line #DDE3E8`, `--line-strong #C8D0D8`
- Text: `--ink #0F172A`, `--ink-muted #64748B`, `--ink-faint #94A3B8`
- Brand & Status:
  - Available: `#1F7A4D` (`--available`)
  - Reserved: `#B7791F` (`--reserved`)
  - Booked: `#0B558B` (`--booked`)
  - Sold: `#9B2C2C` (`--sold`)
  - Brass: `#9A7B4F` (`--accent`) ONLY for the logo hallmark and the active nav bar.
- Radius: `8px` controls/buttons, `12px` cards, `16px` dialogs/modal sheets
- Elevation: `--shadow-card: 0 1px 2px rgba(15,23,42,.04), 0 8px 24px rgba(15,23,42,.06)`; floating layer `--shadow-floating` for dialogs/toasts/popovers. Soft card elevation is allowed via the `.card` utility.

## 2. Control Sizing (Whole App)
One scale across the entire application:
- `md = h-9 (36px)` (default):
  - Button md: `h-9 px-3.5 text-[13px] font-medium gap-1.5 rounded-[8px]`
  - Form controls: Select trigger, Input, DatePicker, search box: all `h-9`, `text-[13px]`, `rounded-[8px]` so they align with buttons.
  - Page header actions: `flex items-center gap-2`, all controls `md` (36px).
- `sm = h-8 (32px)`:
  - Button sm: `h-8 px-3 text-[13px] gap-1.5 rounded-[8px]`
  - Table row actions: all `sm` (size-8 button / dropdown trigger).
- Icon buttons: `size-9` (36px), sm icon `size-8` (32px).
- Icons: strictly 16px (`size-4`), `gap-1.5`, same border width.
- No ad-hoc `h-*`/`py-*`/`px-*`/`text-*`/`rounded-*` className on `Button`/`Select`/`Input` usages.

## 3. App Shell & Spacing Rules
- Sidebar: `h-screen sticky top-0`, user footer pinned at the bottom (`mt-auto`), no blank strip below.
- Main content: `max-w-[1440px] mx-auto px-6 py-6`.
- Spacing rhythm:
  - Page padding: `24px` (`px-6 py-6` / `p-6`)
  - Card gap: `16px` (`gap-4`)
  - Card padding: `20px` (`p-5`)
  - Section gap: `24px` (`gap-6` or `space-y-6`)

## 4. Top Bar & Navigation
- Breadcrumbs left: `text-[13px] text-ink-muted`, parent / child.
- Cmd+K search + user menu right.
- No duplicate page titles: `PageHeader` is the only title on a page.
- Sidebar structure:
  - Inventory: Dashboard, Inventory, Structure, Import
  - Sales: Bookings, Reservations, Installments, Sold
  - Reports: one link → `/reports` with tabs: Summary, Sold, Booked, Reserved, Collections, Client ledger (read-only; rows link to the matching Sales detail page for actions)
  - Admin: Users, Audit log
  - Active item: subtle tint (`bg-subtle font-medium text-ink`) + brass left bar (`bg-accent`, `#9A7B4F`).

## 5. Dashboard
- Layout order:
  - Row 1: 6 stat cards (Available, Reserved, Booked, Sold, Net collected, Reversals this month). Dots match status colours; "Rs 0" with a space; single `formatPkrCompact` Lac/Cr helper used everywhere; count-up animation on numbers.
  - Row 2: "Needs attention" cards: Overdue installments, Due this week, Reservations expiring in 48h; each one clickable to its filtered list.
  - Row 3: Sales over time (2/3) + Inventory mix (1/3).
  - Row 4: Floor stack (2/3) + Recent activity (1/3).
- Columns in each row use `items-stretch` to ensure equal card heights.
- Sales chart: range from the first sale or the last 6 months; bars when < 4 months of data, otherwise a smooth area with a line draw-in animation, hover crosshair + tooltip.
- Inventory mix: real animated donut (`visx Pie`), % sold in the centre, legend in 2 columns, no clipping.
- Floor stack: top floor first, 8px rounded bars, available shown as `#1F7A4D` at 18% opacity, other statuses solid, remove the L-numbers, right label "x% sold" + small booked/reserved counts, widths animate on mount (stagger 30ms), tooltip with counts + value.
- Recent activity: 8 items, readable names, "View all".

## 6. Typography & Motion
- Geist (sans) for UI, headings, buttons, KPIs, money, prices, areas, and chart axes.
- Geist Mono strictly for unit codes (`.unit-code`), IDs, and booking numbers.
- Transitions-dev patterns:
  - Number count-up / pop-in for KPI cards.
  - Page enter transitions (180ms).
  - Modal and panel reveals.
- Always respect `@media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)`.

## 7. Bans
- No Lucide icons (use Phosphor light icons only).
- No purple, rainbow, or loud gradients.
- No Recharts (use visx).
- No raw default shadcn components.
